OL,3,ANvidia says it won't reinstate Huang as
OL,4,Ait reports soaring sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia has firmly ruled out letting
OL,7,Fousted co-founder Jensen Huang return
OL,8,Fas it revealed that sales doubled to
OL,9,Fmore than $100bn.
OL,11,FIn the company's first results since
OL,12,FHuang's dramatic exit last week,
OL,13,Fcovering the three month period just
OL,14,Fbefore the recent scandal surfaced,
OL,15,Finterim chief executive Colette Kress
OL,16,Fsaid it was "business as usual". She
OL,17,Ftold investors: "We've got this."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
