OL,3,ADemocrats win Alaska Senate race two
OL,4,Aweeks after midterms counting began
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrat Mary Peltola has won Alaska's
OL,7,Fhard-fought Senate race, completing a
OL,8,Fsweeping victory for the party in the
OL,9,FUS upper house in the midterm
OL,10,Felections.
OL,12,FThe win gives the Democrats a 56th
OL,13,FSenate seat following a tumultuous and
OL,14,Fcontroversial election in Alaska, which
OL,15,Ffeatured alleged spoiler recruitment
OL,16,Fefforts and unprecedented court
OL,17,Fbattles.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
